libopus 1.6.1
https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/opus/opus-1.6.1.tar.gz
SHA256 6ffcb593207be92584df15b32466ed64bbec99109f007c82205f0194572411a1

Preserved unchanged from the release archive: COPYING, AUTHORS, README,
package_version, the three *_sources.mk files, src/opus_compare.c (built
on Scratch by tools/opus_vectors.py's check) and every file under celt/,
silk/, src/ and include/ that the decoder build compiles or includes.
Excluded: the encoder, multistream, projection and repacketizer code,
build systems, documentation, tests, tools, optional neural models, SIMD
and other architecture variants, float-only code and demos. The
*_sources.mk lists still name excluded files.
port/ contains the local bounded scratch-allocation interface and
decode_only.c, which stands in for the three range-encoder functions.
